(BY SRI YOGESH D. NAIK, AGA FOR R1;
 SRI H.L. PRADEEP KUMAR, ADVOCATE FOR R2 & R3)
 THIS WP IS FILED UNDER ARTICLES 226 & 227 OF THE  CONSTITUTTION OF INDIA, PRAYING TO QUASH THE GENERAL  AWARD BEARING NO.KIADB/LAQ/2014/2023-24 DTD 06.06.2023  PASSED BY THE R3 IN RESPECT OF LAND IN SY.NO.13/3  MEASURING 15 GUNTAS OF LAND SITUATED AT CHAPPARADAHALLI  -2-  NC: 2023:KHC:41415  WP No. 25329 of 2023 VILLAGE, KUNDANA HOBLI, DEVANAHALLI TALUK, BANGALORE RURAL DISTRICT,

This writ petition is filed for following reliefs:
a ) I s s u e W r i t o f C e r t i o r a r i q u a s h i n g t h e G e n e r a l A w a r d b e a r i n g No.KIADB/LAQ/2014/2023-24 dated 06.06.2023 passed by Respondent No.3 in respect of land bearing Sy.no.13/3 measuring 15 guntas of land situated at Chapparadahalli Village, Kundana Hobli, Devanahalli Taluk, Bengaluru Rural District,, as per Annexure-G;
b) Issue any suitable order, direction or writ in nature of Mandamus directing the respondent herein to consider the case of Petitioner as per Section 29(2) of the KIAD Act, etc.
